      "action": "OpenJDK blocks the 16 certificates in releases after 27.0.1, 25.0.5, 21.0.13, 17.0.21, 11.0.33 and 8u512 (CVE-2026-91403); upgrade when your vendor ships one. Until then, replace $JDK_HOME/lib/security/blocked.certs with the file from https://openjdk.org/groups/vulnerability/advisories/2026-10-21 (blacklisted.certs on JDK 8) or enable revocation checking with -Dcom.sun.net.ssl.checkRevocation=true -Dcom.sun.security.enableCRLDP=true. JDKs packaged by Debian, Ubuntu, Fedora or RHEL use the OS store: update ca-certificates."
    }
